Remove the quick pin and archive buttons from sidebar session rows.

On a computer, hovering a session row in the sidebar revealed Pin and Archive
buttons next to its ⋯ button, and they were easy to click by accident. Only
the ⋯ button is left. Pin and Unpin, which upstream showed in the row's menu
only on phones, are now in that menu (and the right-click menu) everywhere;
Archive and Unarchive already were. Dragging a session onto Pinned still pins
it. The title's reserved space on hover shrinks to fit the ⋯ button alone.
Base: omnigent v0.15.0 (c8b9b85f822f).

